{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1539365-qs-and-thoughts-about-anezka-after-watching-a-vtm-r-lp","id":1539365,"title":"Qs and thoughts about Anezka after watching a VTM:R LP","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Vampire: The Masquerade"],"posts":[{"date":"2024-07-26T20:40:38-07:00","id":1539365,"title":"Qs and thoughts about Anezka after watching a VTM:R LP","content":"So, I'm watching a VTMR LP and Anezka pops up. When she came to Ecaterina (The not so wise, apparently) she was noted as having vision, sight. That she had a madness in her eyes that sharpened her mind. The immediate thing that came to mind is that a Malkavian came and hit her with visions and knowledge. I was also thinking she could've been Embraced by one and her ability was an extreme foresight and basically told her and later Christof and the others about the next 800 years in frightening detail. If I were Ecaterina, I'd have Embraced her to take advantage of the knowledge and reunite her with her love, maybe even offer her to Christof as a Ghoul if kept human? Judging from the story and what she potentially knew, I was half expecting Anezka to ask Ecaterina to Embrace her and then surprise Christof with their reunion, with her as a Brujah.<br /> <br /> Also, do you think she actually had knowledge? Or do you think she learned well from that old shopkeeper and played it up to Ecaterina, enough to fool her?<br /> <br /> With Anezka being Embraced in the good ending of the game, what do you think she'd be? A Brujah with Tzimisce tricks after 800 years and her being that trusted, she had to pick up a thing or three. Also, what do you think a Sheet on Anezka would look like since I've never been able to find one. Was their one for her man in a modern day book? Or did I just miss it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/18963-chris313allnight","name":"Chris313AllNight","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"22"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-27T00:08:50-07:00","id":1539369,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Chris313AllNight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1539365-qs-and-thoughts-about-anezka-after-watching-a-vtm-r-lp#post1539365\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So, I'm watching a VTMR LP and Anezka pops up. When she came to Ecaterina (The not so wise, apparently) she was noted as having vision, sight. That she had a madness in her eyes that sharpened her mind. The immediate thing that came to mind is that a Malkavian came and hit her with visions and knowledge. I was also thinking she could've been Embraced by one and her ability was an extreme foresight and basically told her and later Christof and the others about the next 800 years in frightening detail. If I were Ecaterina, I'd have Embraced her to take advantage of the knowledge and reunite her with her love, maybe even offer her to Christof as a Ghoul if kept human? Judging from the story and what she potentially knew, I was half expecting Anezka to ask Ecaterina to Embrace her and then surprise Christof with their reunion, with her as a Brujah.<br /> <br /> Also, do you think she actually had knowledge? Or do you think she learned well from that old shopkeeper and played it up to Ecaterina, enough to fool her?<br /> <br /> With Anezka being Embraced in the good ending of the game, what do you think she'd be? A Brujah with Tzimisce tricks after 800 years and her being that trusted, she had to pick up a thing or three. Also, what do you think a Sheet on Anezka would look like since I've never been able to find one. Was their one for her man in a modern day book? Or did I just miss it?</div> </div> </div> </div>I think that it being the &quot;good ending&quot; is optimistic.<br /> <br /> In my own game's canon, Christof finds that Anezka's humanity has dropped like a stone and she's been on a Path of Enlightenment (Path of Metamorphisis, IMHO) for centuries.<br /> <br /> As such, they end up barely lasting the month before she goes off to be part of the Sabbat.<br /> <br /> Which I feel is appropriately tragic and twisted.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-29T11:42:21-07:00","id":1539487,"title":"","content":"Someone getting a happy ending for a change in vtm would be awesome so imagine her and christoff had a wonderful gothic romance as actually competant brujah.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd70","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26986-ragged-robin","name":"Ragged Robin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar26986_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2021"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1720"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-07-29T11:53:05-07:00","id":1539488,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ragged Robin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1539365-qs-and-thoughts-about-anezka-after-watching-a-vtm-r-lp?p=1539487#post1539487\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Someone getting a happy e