> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-08-07T06:52:34-07:00","id":1539987,"title":"","content":"I for one find the running joke of Christof Romuald being the dictionary definition of Single Target Sexuality and this just making him CATNIP to vampire ladies one of the funniest elements in the whole game (Not least since he never seems to actually notice this).<br /> <br /> Personally, I hope this would remain the case even if his relationship with Vampire Anezka falters - going right back from \u2018Chivalric Romance\u2019 to \u2018Warrior Monk\u2019 - if only because I relinquish Running Jokes only when the ground crumbles away under their feet.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28339-atticus-cleanclaw","name":"Atticus Cleanclaw","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2024"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"638"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}